<div class="post">
<h2>September 05, 2005</h2>


<h1 id="a000012">A Functional Website (At Last)</h1>

<p>T-minus 4 weeks 'til departure and I can finally say that I've got a website that functions (and a keyboard too; <a href="http://www.theroadislife.com/archives/2005/08/you_get_what_yo.htm">the new one</a> came in).  Go ahead give the site a whirl.  I'm most proud of the horizontal navigation bar.  Every single link works now!  </p>

<p>Probably the best decision I've made thus far was to shell out a bit of money for <a href="http://www.cre8d-design.com/">help</a> getting this site up and running. I would have been here a lifetime, and still not have been successful, if I'd done it myself.   For the next few days, if you're looking for content, try the horizontal nav bar above this entry; the links work, but as of right now there isn't any content.  Most of my effort will be focused on updating the <a href="http://www.theroadislife.com/faq.htm">FAQ</a> section.</p>

<p>As always, I'm interested in hearing what others have to say about the  site.  Feel free to leave your comments below or use the '<a href="http://www.theroadislife.com/contact.php">Contact Ryan</a>' link.</p>



